      "notes": "Manual conservative 6-point sleeve traces in EXIF-transposed (browser displayed) 4032x3024 photo coordinates. Top caps, y1500 middle edges, and individual bottom contours are measured independently from visible spines and readable artist/title/catalogue anchors. These masks exclude white box framing, divider gaps, empty top/bay regions, and inter-sleeve black gaps; they are not uniform compartment subdivisions. Very small worn-edge sections between measured anchors are interpolated, with a 2px inset (1px on unresolved slot30). Slots04/30 retain the catalogue uncertainties. Book52 and 3LP box53 have separately measured broad tapered contours. Top-cap x positions use short local interpolation from the measured y500 edge; microcreases and torn fringe are not pixel-perfect segmentation."
